{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02983","headline":"骊山下逍遥公旧居游集 · 张九龄","name":"骊山下逍遥公旧居游集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子体清尚，归处有兼资。\n虽然经济日，无忘幽栖时。\n卜居旧何所，休澣尝来兹。\n岑寂罕人至，幽深获我思。\n松涧聆遗风，兰林览余滋。\n往事诚已矣，道存犹可追。\n遗子後黄金，作歌先紫芝。\n明德有自来，奕世皆秉彝。\n岂与磻溪老，崛起周太师。\n我心希硕人，逮此问元龟。\n怊怅既怀远，沈吟亦省私。\n已云宠禄过，况在华发衰。\n轩盖有迷复，丘壑无磷缁。\n感物重所怀，何但止足斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}